nine primitive holonomic fields and their origin tangents on one common
actual.  The construction remains a frozen-current first germ: it is not a
smoothness theorem, an integral curve, a flow, or a constraint-propagation
certificate.  The derived Cauchy scalar-velocity field is intentionally
outside its primitive slice fidelity.
-/

